WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.264
Open the schedule section. Choose the intended employee and the existing schedule row when correcting one. This example prepares a new synthetic row.

00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:31.800
Enter start and end times. Use school-local times and the approved shift. Check for overlapping coverage.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:42.336
Review the schedule status. Scheduled and Confirmed represent different states. Use the status supported by the actual staffing plan.

00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:54.128
Review before saving. In normal use, save once only with authorization, wait for confirmation, then reopen the record. This demonstration stops before saving.

